#: ../../site/tutorial.md:1
msgid "Tutorial: a monthly performance report from prices"
msgstr "教程：从价格生成一份月度业绩报告"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial builds a small but complete artefact: a price series becomes "
"returns, headline statistics, a rolling view, a monthly table and a rendered"
" report. It takes about fifteen minutes and needs nothing but a compiler and"
" the installed library."
msgstr "本教程构建一个小而完整的产物：价格序列变成收益、头条统计量、滚动视图、月度表以及一份渲染好的报表。大约十五分钟，只需要编译器和已安装的库。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:8
msgid "Values are synthetic. Nothing here is an investment result."
msgstr "数值是合成的。这里没有任何内容构成投资结论。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:10
msgid "Set up"
msgstr "准备工作"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:12
msgid ""
"Build and install the library as described in "
"[installation](installation.md), or add `include/` and the built library to "
"a scratch project. Every snippet below continues from the previous one."
msgstr "按[安装](installation.md)说明构建并安装库，或把 `include/` 与构建出的库加入一个临时工程。下面的片段依次衔接。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:16
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/dataframe.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/drawdown.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/ratios.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/returns.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/html.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/models.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/xlsx.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/rolling_engine.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"#include <cmath>\n"
"#include <cstdio>\n"
"#include <string>\n"
"#include <vector>\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/dataframe.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/drawdown.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/ratios.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/metrics/returns.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/html.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/models.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/xlsx.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/rolling_engine.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"#include <cmath>\n"
"#include <cstdio>\n"
"#include <string>\n"
"#include <vector>\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:32
msgid "Step 1 — Turn prices into returns"
msgstr "第 1 步：把价格变成收益"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:34
msgid ""
"`simple_returns` divides each price by the previous one and drops the first "
"observation, keeping the timestamp of the later price of each pair."
msgstr "`simple_returns` 用每个价格除以前一个，并丢弃第一个观测，保留每对中较晚价格的时间戳。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"std::vector<fincore::timestamp> index;\n"
"std::vector<double> prices;\n"
"const auto day = 86'400'000'000'000LL;\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 260; ++i) {\n"
"    index.push_back(fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 2) + i * day);\n"
"    prices.push_back(100.0 + 6.0 * std::sin(i * 0.11) +\n"
"                     3.0 * std::cos(i * 0.37) + 0.02 * i);\n"
"}\n"
"fincore::dataframe price_frame;\n"
"price_frame.load_index(std::vector<fincore::timestamp>(index));\n"
"price_frame.load_column<double>(\"close\", prices,\n"
"                                hmdf::nan_policy::dont_pad_with_nans);\n"
"\n"
"const auto returns = fincore::simple_returns(price_frame, \"close\");\n"
"std::printf(\"returns: %zu rows\\n\", returns.shape().first);\n"
msgstr ""
"std::vector<fincore::timestamp> index;\n"
"std::vector<double> prices;\n"
"const auto day = 86'400'000'000'000LL;\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 260; ++i) {\n"
"    index.push_back(fincore::utc_timestamp(2025, 1, 2) + i * day);\n"
"    prices.push_back(100.0 + 6.0 * std::sin(i * 0.11) +\n"
"                     3.0 * std::cos(i * 0.37) + 0.02 * i);\n"
"}\n"
"fincore::dataframe price_frame;\n"
"price_frame.load_index(std::vector<fincore::timestamp>(index));\n"
"price_frame.load_column<double>(\"close\", prices,\n"
"                                hmdf::nan_policy::dont_pad_with_nans);\n"
"\n"
"const auto returns = fincore::simple_returns(price_frame, \"close\");\n"
"std::printf(\"returns: %zu rows\\n\", returns.shape().first);\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:55
msgid ""
"Check the row count: 260 prices produce 259 returns, and the first timestamp"
" is the second price's date. If your count differs, the input index probably"
" repeats a date or is unsorted."
msgstr "检查行数：260 个价格产生 259 个收益，第一个时间戳是第二个价格的日期。如果数量不对，通常是输入索引重复了日期或未排序。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:59
msgid "Step 2 — Headline statistics"
msgstr "第 2 步：头条统计量"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:61
#, python-format
msgid ""
"const double sharpe = fincore::sharpe_ratio(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"const double sortino = fincore::sortino_ratio(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"const double drawdown = fincore::max_drawdown(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"const double calmar = fincore::calmar_ratio(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"\n"
"std::printf(\"sharpe %.3f  sortino %.3f  max dd %.3f  calmar %.3f\\n\",\n"
"            sharpe, sortino, drawdown, calmar);\n"
msgstr ""
"const double sharpe = fincore::sharpe_ratio(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"const double sortino = fincore::sortino_ratio(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"const double drawdown = fincore::max_drawdown(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"const double calmar = fincore::calmar_ratio(returns, \"returns\");\n"
"\n"
"std::printf(\"sharpe %.3f  sortino %.3f  max dd %.3f  calmar %.3f\\n\",\n"
"            sharpe, sortino, drawdown, calmar);\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:71
msgid ""
"All four annualize with 252 periods and drop `NaN`. A series that never "
"declines has no drawdown, so `calmar_ratio` returns `NaN` rather than a "
"large number — that is deliberate, and worth handling in your own output."
msgstr ""
"这四个指标都以 252 期年化并丢弃 `NaN`。从不下跌的序列没有回撤，因此 `calmar_ratio` 返回 `NaN` 而不是一个很大的数 ——"
" 这是刻意的，值得在你自己的输出里处理。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:75
msgid "Step 3 — A rolling view"
msgstr "第 3 步：滚动视图"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:77
msgid ""
"`rolling_engine` evaluates metrics over every complete trailing window. A "
"20-observation window therefore starts producing output at row 20, not row "
"1."
msgstr "`rolling_engine` 在每个完整的尾部窗口上评估指标。因此 20 个观测的窗口从第 20 行开始产出，而不是第 1 行。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:80
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"fincore::rolling_engine rolling{returns, std::nullopt, 20U, 252.0};\n"
"const auto series = rolling.compute(\n"
"    {fincore::rolling_metric::sharpe,\n"
"     fincore::rolling_metric::volatility});\n"
"\n"
"for (const auto& [name, frame] : series) {\n"
"    const auto& values = frame.get_column<double>(fincore::returns_column);\n"
"    std::printf(\"%-12s %zu rows, last %.4f\n"
"\", name.c_str(),\n"
"                frame.shape().first, values.back());\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"fincore::rolling_engine rolling{returns, std::nullopt, 20U, 252.0};\n"
"const auto series = rolling.compute(\n"
"    {fincore::rolling_metric::sharpe,\n"
"     fincore::rolling_metric::volatility});\n"
"\n"
"for (const auto& [name, frame] : series) {\n"
"    const auto& values = frame.get_column<double>(fincore::returns_column);\n"
"    std::printf(\"%-12s %zu rows, last %.4f\n"
"\", name.c_str(),\n"
"                frame.shape().first, values.back());\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:94
msgid ""
"The map key names the metric; the output frame still uses the ordinary "
"returns column name, so one loop reads both series."
msgstr "映射的键是指标名；输出帧仍然使用常规的收益列名，因此一个循环即可读取两条序列。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:97
msgid "Step 4 — A monthly table"
msgstr "第 4 步：月度表"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:99
msgid ""
"`aggregate_returns` groups by calendar month and adds integer year and "
"period columns next to the aggregated value."
msgstr "`aggregate_returns` 按日历月分组，并在聚合值旁添加整数年份与期内序号列。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:102
msgid ""
"const auto monthly = fincore::aggregate_returns(\n"
"    returns, fincore::return_aggregation_period::monthly, \"returns\");\n"
"std::printf(\"months: %zu\\n\", monthly.shape().first);\n"
msgstr ""
"const auto monthly = fincore::aggregate_returns(\n"
"    returns, fincore::return_aggregation_period::monthly, \"returns\");\n"
"std::printf(\"months: %zu\\n\", monthly.shape().first);\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:108
msgid ""
"Monthly values are compounded within the month, not summed. That distinction"
" is the usual reason a hand-rolled table disagrees with this one."
msgstr "月度值在月内复利，而不是相加。这个区别通常是手写表格与本表不一致的原因。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:111
msgid "Step 5 — Compare with a benchmark"
msgstr "第 5 步：与基准比较"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:113
#, python-format
msgid ""
"const auto benchmark_prices = price_frame;   // stand-in for a real index\n"
"const auto benchmark = fincore::simple_returns(benchmark_prices, \"close\");"
"\n"
"\n"
"std::printf(\"beta %.3f  alpha %.4f\\n\",\n"
"            fincore::beta(returns, benchmark),\n"
"            fincore::alpha(returns, benchmark));\n"
msgstr ""
"const auto benchmark_prices = price_frame;   // stand-in for a real index\n"
"const auto benchmark = fincore::simple_returns(benchmark_prices, \"close\");"
"\n"
"\n"
"std::printf(\"beta %.3f  alpha %.4f\\n\",\n"
"            fincore::beta(returns, benchmark),\n"
"            fincore::alpha(returns, benchmark));\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:122
msgid ""
"The two frames are paired on the timestamps they share, so a benchmark with "
"a different holiday calendar shortens the sample rather than shifting it."
msgstr "两帧按共有的时间戳配对，因此节假日日历不同的基准会缩短样本，而不是让样本错位。"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:125
msgid "Step 6 — Build and render the report"
msgstr "第 6 步：构建并渲染报表"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:127
msgid ""
"fincore::report_document document;\n"
"document.domain = \"portfolio\";\n"
"document.title = \"Monthly performance review\";\n"
"document.metadata = {{\"source\", \"tutorial\"}, {\"frequency\", "
"\"daily\"}};\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_section section;\n"
"section.key = \"performance\";\n"
"section.title = \"Performance\";\n"
"\n"
"auto add_metric = [&section](std::string key, std::string label, double "
"value) {\n"
"    fincore::report_metric metric;\n"
"    metric.key = std::move(key);\n"
"    metric.label = std::move(label);\n"
"    metric.number = value;\n"
"    section.metrics.push_back(std::move(metric));\n"
"};\n"
"add_metric(\"sharpe\", \"Sharpe ratio\", sharpe);\n"
"add_metric(\"sortino\", \"Sortino ratio\", sortino);\n"
"add_metric(\"max_drawdown\", \"Maximum drawdown\", drawdown);\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_table table;\n"
"table.key = \"monthly_returns\";\n"
"table.title = \"Monthly returns\";\n"
"table.columns = {\"month\", \"return\"};\n"
"for (std::size_t row = 0; row < monthly.shape().first; ++row) {\n"
"    table.rows.push_back(\n"
"        {fincore::report_cell::number_cell(\n"
"             static_cast<double>(row + 1U)),\n"
"         fincore::report_cell::number_cell(\n"
"             monthly.get_column<double>(\"returns\")[row])});\n"
"}\n"
"section.tables.push_back(std::move(table));\n"
"document.sections.push_back(std::move(section));\n"
"\n"
"const std::string html = fincore::render_html(document, {.language = "
"\"en\"});\n"
"const std::string workbook = fincore::render_xlsx(document);\n"
msgstr ""
"fincore::report_document document;\n"
"document.domain = \"portfolio\";\n"
"document.title = \"Monthly performance review\";\n"
"document.metadata = {{\"source\", \"tutorial\"}, {\"frequency\", "
"\"daily\"}};\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_section section;\n"
"section.key = \"performance\";\n"
"section.title = \"Performance\";\n"
"\n"
"auto add_metric = [&section](std::string key, std::string label, double "
"value) {\n"
"    fincore::report_metric metric;\n"
"    metric.key = std::move(key);\n"
"    metric.label = std::move(label);\n"
"    metric.number = value;\n"
"    section.metrics.push_back(std::move(metric));\n"
"};\n"
"add_metric(\"sharpe\", \"Sharpe ratio\", sharpe);\n"
"add_metric(\"sortino\", \"Sortino ratio\", sortino);\n"
"add_metric(\"max_drawdown\", \"Maximum drawdown\", drawdown);\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_table table;\n"
"table.key = \"monthly_returns\";\n"
"table.title = \"Monthly returns\";\n"
"table.columns = {\"month\", \"return\"};\n"
"for (std::size_t row = 0; row < monthly.shape().first; ++row) {\n"
"    table.rows.push_back(\n"
"        {fincore::report_cell::number_cell(\n"
"             static_cast<double>(row + 1U)),\n"
"         fincore::report_cell::number_cell(\n"
"             monthly.get_column<double>(\"returns\")[row])});\n"
"}\n"
"section.tables.push_back(std::move(table));\n"
"document.sections.push_back(std::move(section));\n"
"\n"
"const std::string html = fincore::render_html(document, {.language = "
"\"en\"});\n"
"const std::string workbook = fincore::render_xlsx(document);\n"

#: ../../site/tutorial.md:166
msgid ""
"Write `html` and `workbook` to files and open them: the HTML is self-"
"contained, and the workbook has one sheet per section. Rendering the same "
"document twice produces identical bytes, so the files are safe to hash."
msgstr ""
"把 `html` 与 `workbook` 写入文件并打开：HTML 是自包含的，工作簿每个 section "
"一个工作表。同一文档渲染两次会产生相同字节，因此文件可以安全地哈希。"

